#: ../../source/cli.rst:2
msgid "CLI command reference"
msgstr "CLI 命令参考"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:4
msgid ""
"This page lists every command in the PartCAD command line interface. Both"
" ``pc`` and ``partcad`` invoke the same tool. Run ``pc <command> --help``"
" at any time to see the full, up-to-date options for a command."
msgstr ""
"本页列出了 PartCAD 命令行界面中的每一条命令。 ``pc`` 和 ``partcad`` 都会调用同一个工具。你可以随时运行 ``pc "
"<command> --help`` ，查看某条命令完整且最新的选项。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:7
msgid ""
"Common options, such as ``-v``/``-q`` (verbosity), ``--no-ansi`` (plain-"
"text logs), ``--offline``, ``--threads-max``, and ``-p PATH`` (select the"
" package), apply to every command."
msgstr ""
"一些通用选项适用于每一条命令，例如 ``-v`` / ``-q`` （详细程度）、 ``--no-ansi`` （纯文本日志）、 "
"``--offline`` 、 ``--threads-max`` 以及 ``-p PATH`` （选择包）。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:12
msgid "Host commands"
msgstr "主机命令"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:14
msgid "``pc version``"
msgstr "``pc version``"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:15
msgid "Display the versions of the PartCAD Python module and CLI, then exit."
msgstr "显示 PartCAD Python 模块和 CLI 的版本，然后退出。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:17
msgid "``pc config``"
msgstr "``pc config``"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:18
msgid "Show the current user configuration."
msgstr "显示当前的用户配置。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:20
msgid "``pc system``"
msgstr "``pc system``"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:21
msgid "Manage PartCAD's system-wide state and settings:"
msgstr "管理 PartCAD 的系统级状态和设置："

#: ../../source/cli.rst:23
msgid ""
"``pc system status`` — Display the state of the internal data used by "
"PartCAD, including the location of the local cache."
msgstr "``pc system status`` — 显示 PartCAD 所使用的内部数据的状态，包括本地缓存的位置。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:25
msgid ""
"``pc system reset`` — Reset all internal state maintained by PartCAD, for"
" example to clear a corrupted cache."
msgstr "``pc system reset`` — 重置 PartCAD 维护的所有内部状态，例如用于清除已损坏的缓存。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:27
msgid ""
"``pc system set`` — Set system-wide settings, such as the telemetry type,"
" environment, and Sentry DSN."
msgstr "``pc system set`` — 设置系统级设置，例如遥测类型、环境和 Sentry DSN。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:28
msgid ""
"``pc system telemetry`` — Inspect or clear locally stored telemetry data "
"(``info``, ``clear``)."
msgstr "``pc system telemetry`` — 检查或清除本地存储的遥测数据（ ``info`` 、 ``clear`` ）。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:32
msgid "Package commands"
msgstr "包命令"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:34
msgid "``pc init``"
msgstr "``pc init``"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:35
msgid ""
"Create a new PartCAD package (a ``partcad.yaml`` file) in the current "
"directory. Use ``-i`` for interactive mode, and options such as "
"``--desc``, ``--url``, and ``--manufacturable`` to prefill package "
"metadata."
msgstr ""
"在当前目录中创建一个新的 PartCAD 包（一个 ``partcad.yaml`` 文件）。使用 ``-i`` 进入交互模式，并可使用 "
"``--desc`` 、 ``--url`` 、 ``--manufacturable`` 等选项来预填充包的元数据。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:38
msgid "``pc install``"
msgstr "``pc install``"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:39
msgid "Download and set up all packages imported by the current package."
msgstr "下载并设置当前包所导入的全部包。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:41
msgid "``pc update``"
msgstr "``pc update``"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:42
msgid "Force update all imported packages to their latest versions."
msgstr "强制将所有已导入的包更新到其最新版本。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:44
msgid "``pc lint``"
msgstr "``pc lint``"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:45
msgid ""
"Run linting checks on the files within packages. Use ``-r`` to check "
"imported packages recursively and ``-f`` to run only checks whose name "
"starts with a given prefix."
msgstr "对包内的文件运行代码检查（lint）。使用 ``-r`` 递归检查已导入的包，使用 ``-f`` 仅运行名称以指定前缀开头的检查。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:50
msgid "Object commands"
msgstr "对象命令"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:52
msgid "``pc list``"
msgstr "``pc list``"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:53
msgid ""
"List components. Subcommands select what to list: ``all``, ``parts``, "
"``sketches``, ``assemblies``, ``interfaces``, ``mates``, and "
"``packages``."
msgstr ""
"列出组件。子命令用于选择要列出的内容： ``all`` 、 ``parts`` 、 ``sketches`` 、 ``assemblies`` 、"
" ``interfaces`` 、 ``mates`` 和 ``packages`` 。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:56
msgid "``pc add``"
msgstr "``pc add``"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:57
msgid ""
"Add an object to a package. Subcommands: ``dep`` (a dependency), "
"``sketch``, ``part``, and ``assembly``."
msgstr "向包中添加一个对象。子命令： ``dep`` （依赖项）、 ``sketch`` 、 ``part`` 和 ``assembly`` 。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:59
msgid "``pc import``"
msgstr "``pc import``"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:60
msgid ""
"Import an existing object into a package. Subcommands: ``part`` (import "
"an existing part and optionally convert its format) and ``assembly`` "
"(import an assembly from a file, creating the parts and an Assembly YAML "
"file)."
msgstr ""
"将一个已有对象导入到包中。子命令： ``part`` （导入一个已有零件，并可选择转换其格式）和 ``assembly`` "
"（从文件导入一个装配体，同时创建相应的零件和一个 Assembly YAML 文件）。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:64
msgid "``pc test``"
msgstr "``pc test``"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:65
msgid ""
"Run tests on a part, assembly, or scene. Use ``-r`` to test imported "
"packages recursively, ``-f`` to filter by name prefix, and "
"``-s``/``-i``/``-a``/``-S`` to indicate a sketch, interface, assembly, or"
" scene."
msgstr ""
"对零件、装配体或场景运行测试。使用 ``-r`` 递归测试已导入的包，使用 ``-f`` 按名称前缀过滤，并使用 ``-s`` / ``-i`` "
"/ ``-a`` / ``-S`` 分别表示草图、接口、装配体或场景。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:68
msgid "``pc inspect``"
msgstr "``pc inspect``"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:69
msgid ""
"View a part, assembly, or scene visually. Use ``-V`` for a verbal (text) "
"description instead of a visual one, and ``-p <name>=<value>`` to set "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"以可视化方式查看零件、装配体或场景。使用 ``-V`` 可获得文字（文本）描述而非可视化视图，使用 ``-p <name>=<value>`` "
"来设置参数。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:72
msgid "``pc info``"
msgstr "``pc info``"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:73
msgid ""
"Show detailed information about a part, assembly, or scene, including its"
" parameters."
msgstr "显示关于零件、装配体或场景的详细信息，包括其参数。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:75
msgid "``pc convert``"
msgstr "``pc convert``"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:76
msgid ""
"Convert parts or sketches to another format and update their type in the "
"package. Subcommands: ``part`` and ``sketch``."
msgstr "将零件或草图转换为另一种格式，并在包中更新它们的类型。子命令： ``part`` 和 ``sketch`` 。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:79
msgid "``pc export``"
msgstr "``pc export``"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:80
msgid ""
"Export a 3D view of parts, assemblies, or scenes. Choose the format with "
"``-t``: ``step``, ``brep``, ``stl``, ``3mf``, ``threejs``, ``obj``, "
"``gltf``, or ``iges``. Use ``-O`` to set the output directory and ``-r`` "
"to export recursively."
msgstr ""
"导出零件、装配体或场景的 3D 视图。使用 ``-t`` 选择格式： ``step`` 、 ``brep`` 、 ``stl`` 、 "
"``3mf`` 、 ``threejs`` 、 ``obj`` 、 ``gltf`` 或 ``iges`` 。使用 ``-O`` "
"设置输出目录，使用 ``-r`` 递归导出。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:84
msgid "``pc render``"
msgstr "``pc render``"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:85
msgid ""
"Render a 2D projection of parts, assemblies, or scenes onto a plane. "
"Choose the format with ``-t``: ``svg``, ``png``, or ``readme``."
msgstr "将零件、装配体或场景的 2D 投影渲染到一个平面上。使用 ``-t`` 选择格式： ``svg`` 、 ``png`` 或 ``readme`` 。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:90
msgid "Workflow commands"
msgstr "工作流命令"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:92
msgid "``pc supply``"
msgstr "``pc supply``"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:93
msgid "Manage the supply chain of the current project:"
msgstr "管理当前项目的供应链："

#: ../../source/cli.rst:95
msgid "``pc supply caps`` — Show the capabilities of a provider."
msgstr "``pc supply caps`` — 显示某个提供方的能力。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:96
msgid "``pc supply find`` — Find suppliers."
msgstr "``pc supply find`` — 查找供应商。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:97
msgid "``pc supply quote`` — Get a quote from suppliers."
msgstr "``pc supply quote`` — 从供应商处获取报价。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:98
msgid "``pc supply order`` — Place an order with suppliers."
msgstr "``pc supply order`` — 向供应商下订单。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:102
msgid "Other commands"
msgstr "其他命令"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:104
msgid "``pc adhoc``"
msgstr "``pc adhoc``"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:105
msgid ""
"Ad-hoc operations that run on the fly without creating or configuring a "
"package. Subcommand: ``convert`` (convert a part or sketch to another "
"format without updating its type)."
msgstr ""
"无需创建或配置包即可即时运行的临时性操作。子命令： ``convert`` （将零件或草图转换为另一种格式，但不更新其类型）。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:108
msgid "``pc healthcheck``"
msgstr "``pc healthcheck``"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:109
msgid ""
"Check the host system for known issues. Use ``--dry-run`` to list the "
"available checks, ``--filters`` to run only checks with the given tags, "
"and ``--fix`` to attempt automatic fixes."
msgstr ""
"检查主机系统是否存在已知问题。使用 ``--dry-run`` 列出可用的检查项，使用 ``--filters`` 仅运行带有指定标签的检查，使用"
" ``--fix`` 尝试自动修复。"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:112
msgid "``pc search``"
msgstr "``pc search``"

#: ../../source/cli.rst:113
msgid ""
"Search for objects by keyword. Subcommands: ``all``, ``parts``, "
"``sketches``, ``assemblies``, ``interfaces``, and ``packages``."
msgstr ""
"按关键字搜索对象。子命令： ``all`` 、 ``parts`` 、 ``sketches`` 、 ``assemblies`` 、 "
"``interfaces`` 和 ``packages`` 。"
